---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import WandItem from '../components/WandItem.astro';
import GearControls from '../components/GearControls.astro';
import LevelBands from '../components/LevelBands.astro';
import { data } from '../data/wands';
import '../styles/gear.css';
---
<Layout title="Wands" description="Every wand a warlock can use in WoW Forever, grouped by level.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script is:inline>window.whTooltips = { colorLinks: false, iconizeLinks: false, renameLinks: false };   // read by Wowhead's tooltips.js</script>
    <script is:inline src="https://wow.zamimg.com/js/tooltips.js"></script>
  </Fragment>

  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Wands</h1>
    <p>Wands for warlocks in WoW Forever, sorted by level. Tick the ones you want on your upgrade path.</p>
  </div>

  <GearControls store="wands" total={data.wands.length} noun="wands" one="wand" searchLabel="Search wands, quests, zones and schools"
    kindsOf={data.wands.map((w) => w.source?.kind)} />

  <LevelBands kind="wand" items={data.wands} noun="wands" />

  <details class="extra">
    <summary>{data.noSource.length} more without a known source</summary>
    <p class="muted">These are in the game files, but nobody's found where they drop yet.</p>
    <ul class="wands">{data.noSource.map((w) => <WandItem w={w} pathable={false} />)}</ul>
  </details>

  <script>import '../scripts/gear';</script>

  <div class="notes">
    <p>Info comes from Wowhead's Forever database and the pre-release client's game files (build {data.build}), so things may shift before launch.</p>
    <p>Ticks start on the suggested upgrades: each wand that beats everything before it. Untick one to drop it, or tick any other to add it. "Deselect all" starts you from an empty path; "Use suggested" brings the suggestions back. Your path and filters stay in this browser, and "Share path" copies a link to it; "Reset" puts everything (filters and your ticks) back to how it started.</p>
    <p>A crest means only that faction can get it. "Random enchant" wands roll a bonus suffix with extra stats.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
